SET
  @Description_ae07ca7fde12 = N'Evaluates Population Stability Index (PSI) feature and prediction drift across numeric, categorical, and pre-binned distributions, confidence-floor degradation, and champion-vs-challenger shadow divergence. Loads baseline and rolling evaluation windows from pipeline-generated MJ: Feature Values (Source = ''Pipeline'', human overrides excluded) when RecordProcessID or an MJ: ML Models ModelID is provided, and emits a drift alert notification when thresholds are breached. Because champion Feature Values are upserted in place by ValueKeyHash, each window holds changed values computed in that window (not a full population snapshot), and each evaluation-window challenger row is paired with the latest champion row for the same record and feature. An ML Model process with no challenger configured has no drift population (reports InsufficientData). Feature Values store no latency metrics, so the scheduled sweep reports no P95 latency ratio.'
